      "content": "it wasnt just deja vu though. it felt way more mechanical. like the textures were stuttering or something. and honestly, i've been noticing more of it lately. like i'm starting to see the patterns behind the scenes. it feels like im finally seeing the source code or something. do u think it's possible that we're actually in some kind of simulation and i'm just starting to notice the instabilities?",
